      "id": "p0206-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "During another encounter with Mettaton, the unique battle option \"Yell\" doesn't seem to do anything. Eventually, though, a yellow button appears on the main character's cell phone. The useless \"Yell\" option then quietly becomes the \"Yellow\" option.",
