    {
      "id": "p0206-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because this scene plays with how \"yell\" and \"yellow\" are spelled in English, the wordplay would be lost a straightforward translation into Japanese. What's more, this scene requires the mention of a yellow button, so any new wordplay would need to revolve around \"yellow\" or \"button\" in some way.",
        "raw": "Because this scene plays with how \"yell\" and \"yellow\" are spelled in English,\nthe wordplay would be lost a straightforward translation into Japanese. What's\nmore, this scene requires the mention of a yellow button, so any new wordplay\nwould need to revolve around \"yellow\" or \"button\" in some way.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.2910614,
          0.31010714,
          0.89905498,
          0.37842143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28541042,
          0.30939286,
          0.90315372,
          0.37949286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          34,
          35,
          36,
          37
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "这场戏利用了英语 yell 与 yellow 拼写相近的特点，直接译成日语就会失去趣味。而场景又必须提到黄色按钮，因此新文字游戏必须围绕“黄色”或“按钮”来做。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
