      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Throughout the English version of Undertale, the name \"Mettaton\" is abbreviated as \"MTT\". The localizers were concerned that this abbreviation's meaning might be lost in translation, so the team used a different abbreviation in the Japanese script: \"META\". Some examples include:",
